  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Guinea-Bissau - Revenue Policy and Adminstration</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project supports the tax administration, Direco-geral de Contribuies e Impostos (DGCI), in streamlining and documenting audit procedures, and providing training on use of procedures. Additional activities for 2016 include conducting an in-depth assessment of taxpayer service, developing a handbook of taxpayer service procedures and products such as brochures and a website, and providing training for employees on procedures</narrative>
  </description>
